Package: chisel
Version: 1.12.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, golang
Section: tunnel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jpillora/chisel
Description: Fast TCP/UDP tunnel transported over HTTP, secured via SSH
 chisel creates a fast TCP/UDP tunnel that is transported over HTTP
 and secured via an SSH-like encryption layer. A single executable
 acts as both client and server, supporting port forwarding, reverse
 tunnels and outbound authenticated connections.
